      "writtenOn": "2026-08-20T18:02:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "**Out-of-Order Delivery Risk**:\nIf frame N fails `try_lock()` on the main thread and gets dispatched to `BackgroundExecutor`, and frame N+1 immediately arrives and succeeds on `try_lock()` via the quickpath, frame N+1 will be inserted into `mJankData` before the background thread runs the lambda for frame N.\n\nThis can cause frames to be batched and delivered out of order to `IJankListener` clients (violating chronological `frameVsyncId` ordering).\n\n*(Generated by Jetski)*",
      "revId": "5a4a98160f208460031299168db6e4e2e338e1f0",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
